#. 5.4->settings-schema.json->hotkey-cycle-tiling-mode-backward->tooltip
msgid "Same cycle as \"Cycle tiling mode\", stepping backward - so any mode is at most two presses away in one direction or the other. Clear the binding to disable."
msgstr ""

