#. 5.4->settings-schema.json->hotkey-focus-column-left->tooltip
msgid "Scrollable tiling only: focus the column left of the current one, scrolling it into view. Does nothing in other tiling modes. Clear the binding to disable."
msgstr ""

#. 5.4->settings-schema.json->hotkey-focus-column-right->description
msgid "Focus column to the right"
msgstr ""

#. 5.4->settings-schema.json->hotkey-focus-column-right->tooltip
msgid "Scrollable tiling only: focus the column right of the current one, scrolling it into view. Does nothing in other tiling modes. Clear the binding to disable."
msgstr ""

#. 5.4->settings-schema.json->hotkey-move-column-left->description
msgid "Move column left"
msgstr ""

#. 5.4->settings-schema.json->hotkey-move-column-left->tooltip
msgid "Scrollable tiling only: swap the focused window's column with its left neighbor. Does nothing in other tiling modes. Clear the binding to disable."
msgstr ""

#. 5.4->settings-schema.json->hotkey-move-column-right->description
msgid "Move column right"
msgstr ""

#. 5.4->settings-schema.json->hotkey-move-column-right->tooltip
msgid "Scrollable tiling only: swap the focused window's column with its right neighbor. Does nothing in other tiling modes. Clear the binding to disable."
msgstr ""

